# RIBDIGI BUSINESS ERP — Commercial MVP

Product: **RIBDIGI BUSINESS ERP**  
Release target: **Commercial MVP v1.0**

RIBDIGI is a commercial SaaS ERP built first as an MVP. **MVP is not a demo.**

## Prohibited in production code

- Demo tenants/companies; fake customers, suppliers, products, inventory
- Fake sales, purchases, accounting transactions, backups, or AI results
- Pre-filled login credentials; hard-coded passwords or production secrets
- Fake success responses; placeholder business logic presented as complete

Dev/test fixtures may exist only in clearly isolated development/test environments and must never become production data.

## Completion standard

A feature is **COMPLETE** only when documented MVP acceptance criteria work end-to-end and appropriate automated tests pass. Until then, describe unfinished work as `PARTIAL`, `MISSING`, or `BROKEN` — never as production-ready.
